# Nothing here writes a local database anymore, but restoring an old backup
# (see scripts/migrate-sqlite-to-postgres.cjs) drops one at the repo root —
# a restored database of children's records must never become committable. The
# WAL sidecars appear on any open (the old scripts set journal_mode = WAL) and
# hold uncheckpointed rows, so they are covered too, as is any `.bak`-style
# suffix a backup was copied in under.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.*

# The json test report. CI writes it to assert nothing skipped itself (see the
# "No test skipped itself" step in .github/workflows/ci.yml), and running that
# same command locally to reproduce a CI result drops it here too.
vitest-results.json

# Playwright tooling
.playwright-cli/
.playwright-mcp/

# Root-level screenshot artifacts
/*.png
